ur line with cross product, we obtain that its vector equation is \n\n$$\nr=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+t\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTo find the image of the line $r=p+tv$ under the action of $T$, we need to compute the images of $p$ and $v$ under the action of $T:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T(p) & =T\\,p \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-6 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ T(v) & =T\\,v \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ -5 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation of the image is $r=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}+t\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ -5 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix}.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186654300 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a5b49924-ce23-5139-9e41-acb55cef441e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "r=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 \\\\ 7 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+t\\begin{bmatrix}-7 \\\\ 8 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186653934} {:answer/id #uuid "a6bec0bd-5abf-5e0a-a7a4-4dc68e3d4dc2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "r=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 7 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+t\\begin{bmatrix}10 \\\\ -10 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186653938} {:answer/id #uuid "f0c81b17-b4df-5dab-948c-858f87584ed0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "r=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+t\\begin{bmatrix}-10 \\\\ 10 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186654094} {:answer/id #uuid "f75919d7-b174-5d2b-9494-a07d1b3c71e8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "r=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+t\\begin{bmatrix}8 \\\\ -8 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186654107} {:answer/id #uuid "f9f4dc